No!

262
00:16:36,230 --> 00:16:36,750
No!

263
00:16:37,110 --> 00:16:38,110
Naruto!

264
00:16:38,190 --> 00:16:40,170
You've got a self-abusive personality!

265
00:16:41,090 --> 00:16:42,790
It's called masochism!

266
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:53,340
The wound... it's already starting to
heal.

267
00:17:02,870 --> 00:17:04,069
You failed.

268
00:17:04,369 --> 00:17:06,069
You failed?!

269
00:17:06,070 --> 00:17:08,130
What is this, amateur knight?

270
00:17:08,230 --> 00:17:09,849
I put out big money for you!

271
00:17:10,130 --> 00:17:12,650
I thought you were supposed to be hotshot
assassins!

272
00:17:13,250 --> 00:17:14,690
Stop whining.

273
00:17:19,910 --> 00:17:22,069
This time, I'll go personally.

274
00:17:22,070 --> 00:17:26,130
And this sword will be the last thing he
ever sees.

275
00:17:27,470 --> 00:17:29,110
You sure about that?

276
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:32,730
Apparently, Tatsuna has a high-level ninja
guarding him.

277
00:17:32,930 --> 00:17:36,510
And since your first attempt failed,
they'll be expecting you back.

278
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:38,610
They'll be waiting, watching.

279
00:17:38,830 --> 00:17:41,390
It'll take someone with very advanced
skills!

280
00:17:41,810 --> 00:17:43,730
Who do you think you're dealing with?

281
00:17:48,150 --> 00:17:50,850
The Demon of the Hidden Mist.

282
00:18:11,955 --> 00:18:13,480
This fog's so thick.

283
00:18:13,790 --> 00:18:14,790
You can't see anything.

284
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:18,040
The bridge isn't far now.

285
00:18:19,569 --> 00:18:21,060
Our destination's just ahead.

286
00:18:21,609 --> 00:18:22,609
The Land of Waves.

287
00:18:45,950 --> 00:18:46,950
It's huge!

288
00:18:47,410 --> 00:18:47,970
What?

289
00:18:48,030 --> 00:18:48,370
Quiet!

290
00:18:48,650 --> 00:18:49,930
I told you, no noise!

291
00:18:50,270 --> 00:18:52,450
Why do you think we're traveling like
this, huh?

292
00:18:53,530 --> 00:18:55,530
Cutting off the engine and rowing?

293
00:18:55,830 --> 00:18:59,410
Moving through the dense fog, so they
don't see us?

294
00:19:05,010 --> 00:19:06,370
Mr. Tatsuna...

295
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:13,070
Before we reach the pier, I want to ask
you something.

296
00:19:17,860 --> 00:19:22,080
The men who are after you... I need to
know why.

297
00:19:22,540 --> 00:19:24,640
If you don't tell us...

298
00:19:24,641 --> 00:19:29,300
I'm afraid I'll have to end this mission
when we drop you ashore.

299
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:36,480
I have no choice but to tell you.

300
00:19:36,980 --> 00:19:37,540
No.

301
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:39,660
I want you to know the truth.

302
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:45,000
Like you said, this is beyond the scope of
the original mission.

303
00:19:46,269 --> 00:19:48,871
The one who seeks
my life is a very short

304
00:19:48,872 --> 00:19:51,840
man who casts a very
long and deadly shadow.

305
00:19:52,220 --> 00:19:53,080
But who is it?

306
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:54,320
You know him.

307
00:19:54,321 --> 00:19:56,580
At least I'm sure you've heard his name
before.

308
00:19:57,989 --> 00:20:00,220
He's one of the wealthiest men in the
world.

309
00:20:00,919 --> 00:20:02,440
The shipping magnate, Gato.

310
00:20:02,840 --> 00:20:03,100
Huh?

311
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:04,760
Gato?

312
00:20:05,429 --> 00:20:06,429
Of Gato Transport?

313
00:20:07,509 --> 00:20:08,509
He's a business leader.

314
00:20:08,620 --> 00:20:09,620
Everyone knows him.

315
00:20:10,069 --> 00:20:13,520
He's a very powerful tycoon from a famous
company, that's true.

316
00:20:14,020 --> 00:20:19,300
But below the surface, with the same
ruthless methods he uses to take over

317
00:20:19,301 --> 00:20:24,420
businesses and nations, he sells drugs and
contraband.

318
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:27,520
Using gangs and ninja.

319
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:36,960
It was one year ago, when Gato first set
his sight on the land of waves.

320
00:20:37,620 --> 00:20:41,185
He came to our island
and used his vast wealth to

321
00:20:41,186 --> 00:20:44,060
take total control of our
transport and shipping.

322
00:20:44,460 --> 00:20:48,480
Anyone who tried to stand in his way
simply... disappeared.

323
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:50,620
In an island nation.

324
00:20:50,621 --> 00:20:53,420
A man who controls the sea controls
everything.

325
00:20:54,020 --> 00:20:56,140
Finance, government, our very lives.

326
00:20:56,500 --> 00:20:59,040
But there's one thing he fears.

327
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:00,340
The bridge.

328
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:05,840
When it is complete, it will join us to
the land and that will break his control.

329
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:08,000
I don't understand.

330
00:21:08,799 --> 00:21:12,212
If you knew he was
dangerous, knew he'd send ninja

331
00:21:12,213 --> 00:21:15,160
to eliminate you, why
did you hide that from us?

332
00:21:16,829 --> 00:21:18,360
Because the land of waves...

333
00:21:18,809 --> 00:21:21,160
is a small, impoverished nation.

334
00:21:22,439 --> 00:21:24,220
Even our nobles have little money.

335
00:21:25,469 --> 00:21:28,100
They can't pay for an A or B ranked
mission.

336
00:21:28,869 --> 00:21:29,869
It's too expensive.

337
00:21:30,884 --> 00:21:33,760
If you end the mission when you drop me
ashore...

338
00:21:34,509 --> 00:21:35,780
there will be no bridge.

339
00:21:36,849 --> 00:21:39,620
They'll assassinate me before I reach
home.

340
00:21:42,475 --> 00:21:44,840
But... don't feel bad about that.

341
00:21:45,769 --> 00:21:48,600
Of course my sweet little
grandson will be able to... be upset.

342
00:21:48,860 --> 00:21:49,860
He'll cry...

343
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:50,960
Granddad!

344
00:21:51,120 --> 00:21:52,580
I want my granddad!

345
00:21:53,380 --> 00:21:54,380
Oh.

346
00:21:55,740 --> 00:21:59,080
And my daughter will condemn the ninja of
the Hidden Leaves...

347
00:21:59,081 --> 00:22:03,220
denouncing and blaming you for abandoning
her father and living her life in sorrow.

348
00:22:08,100 --> 00:22:08,380
Well...

349
00:22:09,120 --> 00:22:10,880
I guess we have no other choice.

350
00:22:11,319 --> 00:22:12,599
We'll have to keep guarding you.

351
00:22:13,900 --> 00:22:14,900
I win.

352
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:20,580
We're approaching the shore.

353
00:22:21,120 --> 00:22:22,120
Tazuna.

354
00:22:22,394 --> 00:22:23,434
We've been very fortunate.

355
00:22:23,554 --> 00:22:24,920
No one has noticed us so far.

356
00:22:25,580 --> 00:22:26,580
Nice going.

357
00:22:44,870 --> 00:22:45,870
Yeah!

358
00:22:53,820 --> 00:22:55,180
That's as far as I go.

359
00:22:55,700 --> 00:22:56,700
Good luck.

360
00:22:56,920 --> 00:22:57,440
Right.

361
00:22:57,860 --> 00:22:59,780
Thank you for taking such a risk.

362
00:23:00,220 --> 00:23:01,300
Just be careful.

363
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:14,160
Okay.

364
00:23:14,560 --> 00:23:15,980
Take me to my home.

365
00:23:16,080 --> 00:23:18,100
And I mean get me there in one piece.

366
00:23:18,300 --> 00:23:18,680
Right.

367
00:23:19,120 --> 00:23:19,640
I'll be there in a minute.

368
00:23:19,889 --> 00:23:22,700
The next ninja they send won't be Chunin.

369
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:24,080
They'll be Jonin.

370
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:26,480
Elite ninja with deadly skills.

371
00:23:39,959 --> 00:23:42,420
I'm not letting Sasuke get all the glory
this time.

372
00:23:42,520 --> 00:23:43,520
Believe it.

373
00:23:48,520 --> 00:23:49,520
Over there!

374
00:23:53,160 --> 00:23:55,280
It was just a mouse.

375
00:23:55,600 --> 00:23:56,280
Mouse?

376
00:23:56,281 --> 00:23:56,900
Yeah, right.

377
00:23:57,040 --> 00:23:58,700
Everyone can see through your stupid act.

378
00:23:58,740 --> 00:24:00,180
You're so obvious it's embarrassing.

379
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:01,680
Naruto.

380
00:24:01,760 --> 00:24:03,320
Those are kunai knives.

381
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:04,640
They're dangerous.

382
00:24:05,740 --> 00:24:08,560
Stop trying to scare me, you scruffy
little dwarf!

383
00:24:09,020 --> 00:24:09,540
Hey.

384
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:10,980
Is someone hiding over there?

385
00:24:11,120 --> 00:24:11,720
No.

386
00:24:11,740 --> 00:24:12,740
They're over there.

387
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:15,660
That's it, Naruto.

388
00:24:16,820 --> 00:24:17,420
What?

389
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:18,880
Why'd you do that?

390
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:20,780
Someone really is following us.

391
00:24:20,820 --> 00:24:21,820
I mean it.

392
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:23,000
Yeah, right.

393
00:24:23,320 --> 00:24:25,520
Quit lying and acting like a dumb kid.

394
00:24:25,521 --> 00:24:26,521
Oh, I'm out of here.

395
00:24:27,860 --> 00:24:28,860
Naruto!

396
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:29,700
Look what you did!

397
00:24:29,880 --> 00:24:31,101
A... A rabbit!

398
00:24:31,520 --> 00:24:33,100
Sorry, little rabbit.

399
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,200
I'm sorry.

400
00:24:34,380 --> 00:24:36,540
Now this fuss over our rodent.

401
00:24:38,675 --> 00:24:40,160
That's a snow rabbit.

402
00:24:41,040 --> 00:24:45,320
But the color... They only
have white fur during winter.

403
00:24:45,600 --> 00:24:48,300
When the days are short and there's little
sunlight.

404
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:52,348
This rabbit was raised
indoors, away from the

405
00:24:52,349 --> 00:24:54,921
light, which could only
be for one purpose.

406
00:25:06,900 --> 00:25:07,660
Hmm.

407
00:25:07,661 --> 00:25:11,040
No wonder the Demon Brothers failed in
their mission.

408
00:25:12,760 --> 00:25:16,500
It's the copy ninja from the village
hidden in the leaves.

409
00:25:16,940 --> 00:25:18,900
Kakashi of the Sharingan.

410
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:39,110
That must be...
I'm ready this time.

411
00:25:39,230 --> 00:25:41,530
I'm not gonna lose out to Sasuke!

412
00:25:42,510 --> 00:25:45,319
Well, well, if it isn't
Zabuza Momochi, rogue

413
00:25:45,320 --> 00:25:49,031
ninja from the village
hidden in the mist.

414
00:25:49,370 --> 00:25:49,710
Ready?

415
00:25:50,110 --> 00:25:51,110
Go!

416
00:25:52,270 --> 00:25:53,350
Get back.

417
00:25:54,070 --> 00:25:56,190
He's not like those other ninja.

418
00:25:56,630 --> 00:25:58,730
He's in a whole other league.

419
00:25:59,830 --> 00:26:02,030
If he's our opponent...

420
00:26:04,290 --> 00:26:06,750
This could be treacherous.

421
00:26:07,850 --> 00:26:10,010
Kakashi of the Sharingan Eye.

422
00:26:10,330 --> 00:26:11,710
Did I get that right?

423
00:26:13,330 --> 00:26:14,810
It's too bad, huh?

424
00:26:15,390 --> 00:26:17,850
But you'll have to hand over the old man.

425
00:26:23,590 --> 00:26:25,230
Sharingan, what is that?

426
00:26:25,510 --> 00:26:26,510
Now quick!

427
00:26:26,550 --> 00:26:27,550
Manji formation!

428
00:26:28,370 --> 00:26:31,610
Protect the bridge builder and stay out of
this fight.

429
00:26:31,770 --> 00:26:33,290
I taught you teamwork.

430
00:26:33,550 --> 00:26:35,110
Now it's time to use it.

431
00:26:40,910 --> 00:26:41,910
I'm ready.

432
00:26:45,430 --> 00:26:46,430
His eye!

433
00:26:46,550 --> 00:26:47,550
What is that?

434
00:26:47,610 --> 00:26:51,590
Well, looks like I get to see the
Sharingan in action.

435
00:26:52,270 --> 00:26:53,790
This is an honor.

436
00:26:53,791 --> 00:26:56,430
Everyone keeps saying, Sharingan,
Sharingan.

437
00:26:56,570 --> 00:26:58,790
Will someone please tell me what Sharingan
is?

438
00:26:59,450 --> 00:27:00,450
Sharingan.

439
00:27:00,650 --> 00:27:02,190
A rare power.

440
00:27:02,390 --> 00:27:04,170
It resides in the eyes.

441
00:27:04,930 --> 00:27:09,290
The Sharingan is a special, rare form of
doujutsu.

442
00:27:11,370 --> 00:27:14,190
However, there's more to the Sharingan
than that.

443
00:27:14,290 --> 00:27:15,350
A lot more.

444
00:27:17,070 --> 00:27:18,650
You got it right, boy.

445
00:27:19,050 --> 00:27:21,290
But you only scratched the surface.

446
00:27:24,730 --> 00:27:26,370
As for you, Jonin.

447
00:27:26,650 --> 00:27:29,856
In the assassination
unit of the Hidden Mist,

448
00:27:29,857 --> 00:27:33,311
we had a standing order
to destroy you on sight.

449
00:27:33,690 --> 00:27:36,230
Your profile was in our bingo book.

450
00:27:36,490 --> 00:27:40,770
It called you the man who copied over a
thousand jutsu.

451
00:27:41,170 --> 00:27:43,530
Kakashi, the Copy Ninja.

452
00:27:44,520 --> 00:27:45,520
What?

453
00:27:45,590 --> 00:27:48,990
Is Kakashi-sensei such a famous ninja?

454
00:27:49,470 --> 00:27:50,170
Wow!

455
00:27:50,430 --> 00:27:51,370
That's so cool!

456
00:27:51,371 --> 00:27:56,830
The Sharingan is a rare trait that only
occurs in a few members of the Uchiha clan.

457
00:27:57,110 --> 00:27:58,110
My clan.

458
00:27:58,430 --> 00:28:00,170
Could he be...

459
00:28:01,730 --> 00:28:02,970
Enough talking.

460
00:28:04,170 --> 00:28:06,830
I need to exterminate the old man.

461
00:28:07,550 --> 00:28:08,550
Now.

462
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:18,450
So, I'll have to eliminate you first,
eh, Kakashi?

463
00:28:18,770 --> 00:28:20,050
So be it.

464
00:28:27,650 --> 00:28:28,250
I'll have to eliminate you first,
eh, Kakashi?

465
00:28:28,251 --> 00:28:28,710
He's over there!

466
00:28:29,010 --> 00:28:30,070
Standing on the water!

467
00:28:31,550 --> 00:28:33,850
He's building up a huge amount of chakra.

468
00:28:34,550 --> 00:28:37,350
Ninja Arch, Hidden Mist Jutsu!

469
00:28:41,370 --> 00:28:42,570
He vanished!

470
00:28:43,170 --> 00:28:45,090
He'll come after me first.

471
00:28:46,050 --> 00:28:47,750
But... who is he?

472
00:28:48,110 --> 00:28:49,330
Zabuza Momochi.

473
00:28:49,490 --> 00:28:51,270
The ex-leader of the Hidden Mist
Association.

474
00:28:51,370 --> 00:28:54,850
He's a master of the Silent Killing
Technique.

475
00:28:55,114 --> 00:28:57,030
So don't lower your guard.

476
00:29:03,150 --> 00:29:04,150
The

477
00:29:07,780 --> 00:29:10,000
mist is getting thicker and thicker!

478
00:29:10,380 --> 00:29:13,060
The Land of Waves is surrounded by ocean.

479
00:29:13,320 --> 00:29:15,560
The swirling mists are ever-present.

480
00:29:18,980 --> 00:29:19,980
Sensei!

481
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:23,100
Eight points.

482
00:29:24,120 --> 00:29:25,120
What's that?

483
00:29:26,840 --> 00:29:34,840
Larynx... spine... lungs... liver...
jugular... subclavian artery... kidneys...

484
00:29:34,841 --> 00:29:39,500
heart... Now... which
will be my kill point?

485
00:29:45,280 --> 00:29:49,180
What an intense thirst for blood.

486
00:29:49,940 --> 00:29:51,860
One shallow breath...

487
00:29:51,861 --> 00:29:55,840
One tiny movement of the eye is enough to
bring on instant death.

488
00:29:57,000 --> 00:29:57,640
No.

489
00:29:57,940 --> 00:29:59,340
I can't bear it.

490
00:29:59,480 --> 00:30:01,500
I'd rather take my own life.

491
00:30:01,780 --> 00:30:02,780
Sasuke!

492
00:30:03,660 --> 00:30:04,660
Calm down.

493
00:30:04,940 --> 00:30:07,000
I'll protect you with my life.

494
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:08,300
All of you.

495
00:30:08,380 --> 00:30:11,480
I will not allow my comrades to die.

496
00:30:12,140 --> 00:30:13,140
Trust me.

497
00:30:13,280 --> 00:30:14,900
I wouldn't be so sure.

498
00:30:16,060 --> 00:30:17,080
It's over.

499
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:23,720
Look!

500
00:30:35,590 --> 00:30:36,530
Sensei!

501
00:30:36,531 --> 00:30:37,531
Behind you!

502
00:30:39,080 --> 00:30:40,080
Die!

503
00:30:45,070 --> 00:30:47,430
The Water Clone, Jutsu.

504
00:30:47,590 --> 00:30:49,530
It can't be...

505
00:30:56,590 --> 00:30:57,830
Don't move.

506
00:30:59,230 --> 00:31:00,450
Now it's over.

507
00:31:01,230 --> 00:31:02,310
All right!

508
00:31:12,900 --> 00:31:15,480
You really don't get it, do you?

509
00:31:15,660 --> 00:31:18,360
Your technique is nothing but a crass
imitation.

510
00:31:19,034 --> 00:31:22,560
I'll never be defeated by a mere copycat
ninja like you.

511
00:31:23,640 --> 00:31:25,980
You are full of surprises, though.

512
00:31:26,420 --> 00:31:30,620
You'd already copied my Water Clone,
Jutsu, when you made your little speech.

513
00:31:33,280 --> 00:31:33,960
You can't be so sure.

514
00:31:33,961 --> 00:31:35,460
I'll protect you with my life.

515
00:31:35,680 --> 00:31:36,760
All of you.

516
00:31:37,499 --> 00:31:39,480
Very skillfully executed.

517
00:31:40,760 --> 00:31:45,949
You made your clone say
those words to draw my attention

518
00:31:45,950 --> 00:31:50,760
while you hid in the mist,
waiting for me to make my move.

519
00:31:52,999 --> 00:31:53,999
Nice try.

520
00:31:54,314 --> 00:31:56,520
I'm not that easy to fool.

521
00:32:07,030 --> 00:32:08,030
Now.

522
00:32:12,550 --> 00:32:13,650
Makibishi spikes.

523
00:32:14,630 --> 00:32:16,450
Trying to slow me down.

524
00:32:17,950 --> 00:32:18,950
Foolish.

525
00:32:23,010 --> 00:32:25,010
This isn't normal water.

526
00:32:25,170 --> 00:32:26,190
It's dense.

527
00:32:26,310 --> 00:32:27,310
Heavy.

528
00:32:28,850 --> 00:32:29,070
Fool.

529
00:32:29,710 --> 00:32:31,510
Water prison jutsu!

530
00:32:31,650 --> 00:32:32,650
No!

531
00:32:35,250 --> 00:32:36,570
Escaping into the water?

532
00:32:36,750 --> 00:32:37,750
Bad mistake.

533
00:32:41,750 --> 00:32:45,950
This prison is made of water, but it's
stronger than steel.

534
00:32:46,390 --> 00:32:48,330
I'll finish you off later.

535
00:32:48,670 --> 00:32:52,250
But first, your little friends will have
to be eliminated.

536
00:32:53,730 --> 00:32:55,670
Water clone jutsu!

537
00:32:56,690 --> 00:32:58,710
He's even more skilled than I thought.

538
00:33:08,940 --> 00:33:12,360
You think wearing a headband makes you a
ninja?

539
00:33:12,920 --> 00:33:18,300
When you've hovered between life and death
so many times it doesn't faze you,

540
00:33:18,420 --> 00:33:21,280
then you may be called a ninja.

541
00:33:21,800 --> 00:33:26,591
When you've become so
deadly your profile is entered in

542
00:33:26,592 --> 00:33:31,200
my bingo book, then you
may have earned the title ninja.

543
00:33:31,780 --> 00:33:36,540
But to call upstarts like you ninja is a
jerk.

544
00:33:37,320 --> 00:33:38,480
He disappeared again!

545
00:33:47,420 --> 00:33:49,040
You're just brats.

546
00:33:50,320 --> 00:33:51,320
Naruto!

547
00:33:53,820 --> 00:33:54,340
Listen!

548
00:33:54,580 --> 00:33:56,300
Get the bridge builder and run!

549
00:33:56,460 --> 00:33:58,180
You can't win this fight!

550
00:33:59,240 --> 00:34:01,949
He's using all his power
to keep me in this prison,

551
00:34:01,950 --> 00:34:04,160
so he can only fight
you with his water clone.

552
00:34:04,161 --> 00:34:07,120
But the clone can't go far from his real
body.

553
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:09,420
If you get away from him, he can't follow.

554
00:34:09,600 --> 00:34:10,600
Now run!

555
00:34:17,199 --> 00:34:18,199
Sasuke, no!

556
00:34:18,679 --> 00:34:20,080
He got Sasuke!

557
00:34:23,739 --> 00:34:25,960
So this is what a Jonin is.

558
00:34:26,179 --> 00:34:27,699
A true elite ninja.

559
00:34:28,560 --> 00:34:29,560
Seriously!

560
00:34:29,760 --> 00:34:31,340
He'll annihilate me!

561
00:34:57,670 --> 00:34:59,950
Now I saw how命 come over here for a
minute.

562
00:35:00,410 --> 00:35:02,650
I've got something special I want to give
you.

563
00:35:04,410 --> 00:35:05,410
Congratulations.

564
00:35:05,830 --> 00:35:06,830
You graduate.

565
00:35:07,990 --> 00:35:09,130
That's what happens.

566
00:35:09,370 --> 00:35:12,810
An enemy takes a hostage and you have an
impossible choice.

567
00:35:14,350 --> 00:35:17,190
On every mission, your life is on the
line.

568
00:35:18,730 --> 00:35:19,730
You pass.

569
00:35:20,430 --> 00:35:23,430
I'm not the little brat who used to pull
pranks all the time!

570
00:35:23,570 --> 00:35:25,990
I'm a ninja now and I want a ninja
mission!

571
00:35:26,790 --> 00:35:28,570
To be the greatest Hokage!

572
00:35:28,571 --> 00:35:30,964
Then the whole village
will stop disrespecting

573
00:35:30,965 --> 00:35:33,251
me and start treating
me like I'm somebody!

574
00:35:33,310 --> 00:35:34,310
Somebody important!

575
00:35:35,770 --> 00:35:36,770
That's right.

576
00:35:36,910 --> 00:35:38,350
I'm a ninja now.

577
00:35:38,590 --> 00:35:39,730
Believe it!

578
00:35:41,330 --> 00:35:43,950
I swore an oath of pain!

579
00:35:45,270 --> 00:35:46,610
I won't run away!

580
00:35:48,470 --> 00:35:49,470
Fool.

581
00:36:01,670 --> 00:36:03,970
What are you thinking, charging at him by
yourself?

582
00:36:04,310 --> 00:36:06,190
Even Sasuke couldn't get to him!

583
00:36:06,430 --> 00:36:07,530
We're only Ganine.

584
00:36:07,550 --> 00:36:08,670
We can't defeat a Jonine.

585
00:36:08,850 --> 00:36:10,590
What did you think you'd accomplish by
that?

586
00:36:22,340 --> 00:36:23,340
The headband?

587
00:36:25,940 --> 00:36:27,020
That's what he wanted?

588
00:36:41,540 --> 00:36:42,980
The headband?

589
00:36:42,981 --> 00:36:45,260
Hey, you.

590
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:47,020
The freak with no eyebrows.

591
00:36:49,060 --> 00:36:51,420
Put this in your bingo book.

592
00:36:51,980 --> 00:36:56,020
The ninja that will become Hokage of the
village, hidden in the leaves.

593
00:36:57,060 --> 00:36:58,820
He never backs down.

594
00:37:00,200 --> 00:37:02,620
His name's Naruto Uzumaki.

595
00:37:07,260 --> 00:37:10,860
I thought he was all talk, but this kid's
got guts.

596
00:37:11,640 --> 00:37:12,880
All right, Sasuke.

597
00:37:13,220 --> 00:37:14,060
Listen up.

598
00:37:14,061 --> 00:37:14,680
Can you hear me?

599
00:37:14,940 --> 00:37:15,960
Yeah, I hear you.

600
00:37:16,060 --> 00:37:17,120
I've got a plan.

601
00:37:18,580 --> 00:37:21,460
So you're finally thinking about teamwork,
huh?

602
00:37:22,680 --> 00:37:24,460
Why do I have this feeling?

603
00:37:25,440 --> 00:37:27,380
Naruto's so... determined.

604
00:37:28,780 --> 00:37:29,720
All right.

605
00:37:29,721 --> 00:37:32,600
Now, guys, let's go wild!

606
00:37:34,444 --> 00:37:36,760
Big words for such a little man.

607
00:37:37,360 --> 00:37:39,680
You think your plan's going to keep you in
the game?

608
00:37:40,600 --> 00:37:41,860
This isn't good.

609
00:37:42,280 --> 00:37:43,440
What are you doing?

610
00:37:43,540 --> 00:37:44,540
I told you to run!

611
00:37:44,720 --> 00:37:47,020
This fight was over the moment I got
caught!

612
00:37:47,280 --> 00:37:48,280
Now take off!

613
00:37:48,940 --> 00:37:51,840
Your mission is not to prove how brave you
are!

614
00:37:51,980 --> 00:37:53,860
It's to save the Bridge Builder!

615
00:37:53,900 --> 00:37:55,380
Stay on mission!

616
00:37:57,635 --> 00:37:58,635
Bridge Builder?

617
00:37:59,455 --> 00:38:02,920
Well, I... I guess this all happened
because of me.

618
00:38:03,180 --> 00:38:04,980
Because of my desire to live.

619
00:38:04,981 --> 00:38:07,460
But I won't let that stand in your way
now.

620
00:38:08,870 --> 00:38:11,240
Forget about me and do what you have to
do!

621
00:38:11,710 --> 00:38:13,920
Go ahead and fight to save your sensei!

622
00:38:14,114 --> 00:38:16,100
All right.

623
00:38:16,220 --> 00:38:17,220
You hear that?

624
00:38:18,160 --> 00:38:19,000
Yeah, believe it.

625
00:38:19,020 --> 00:38:20,020
You ready?

626
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:33,420
You really haven't learned anything,
have you?

627
00:38:34,980 --> 00:38:38,840
Still playing your little game,
pretending to be ninja?

628
00:38:39,700 --> 00:38:44,360
When I was your age, this hand had already
crushed many opponents.

629
00:38:46,720 --> 00:38:48,520
Zabuza, the demon.

630
00:38:49,100 --> 00:38:53,560
Oh, so I was in your book too,
huh?

631
00:38:55,540 --> 00:39:00,320
Long ago, in the village hidden in the
mist, also known as Blood Mist Village,

632
00:39:00,620 --> 00:39:04,940
before a student could become a ninja,
there was one final test.

633
00:39:06,540 --> 00:39:09,460
Do you know about the graduation exam?

634
00:39:10,840 --> 00:39:12,640
What graduation exam?

635
00:39:15,120 --> 00:39:16,900
What's the big deal, anyway?

636
00:39:17,100 --> 00:39:19,080
We had graduation tests too!

637
00:39:23,640 --> 00:39:27,380
Did you have to kill the other students to
pass?

638
00:39:27,900 --> 00:39:28,280
Huh?

639
00:39:28,281 --> 00:39:29,281
Huh?

640
00:39:32,200 --> 00:39:35,520
Imagine young ninja
like you, eating together,

641
00:39:35,521 --> 00:39:38,780
training together, and
then comes the final exam.

642
00:39:39,160 --> 00:39:40,960
Only they change the rules.

643
00:39:41,340 --> 00:39:42,860
Kill or be killed.

644
00:39:43,160 --> 00:39:46,260
You can't stop while your opponent still
breathes.

645
00:39:46,300 --> 00:39:48,540
He was your friend, shared your dreams.

646
00:39:48,820 --> 00:39:51,080
Now it's him or you.

647
00:39:51,540 --> 00:39:52,640
That's so cruel!

648
00:39:53,860 --> 00:40:00,180
Ten years ago, in the village hidden in
the mist, the graduation exam changed.

649
00:40:01,220 --> 00:40:06,240
One year before, a dark evil had filled
the school with terror.

650
00:40:07,660 --> 00:40:08,840
What evil?

651
00:40:09,480 --> 00:40:10,940
What kind of change?

652
00:40:11,040 --> 00:40:12,140
What caused the terror?

653
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:19,420
Without pause or hesitation, a young boy
who was not even a ninja approached the

654
00:40:19,421 --> 00:40:22,660
class and took down over a hundred other
students.

655
00:40:22,940 --> 00:40:23,020
Oh!

656
00:40:23,680 --> 00:40:24,200
Oh!

657
00:40:24,220 --> 00:40:24,700
Oh!

658
00:40:24,701 --> 00:40:25,100
Oh!

659
00:40:25,200 --> 00:40:25,580
Oh!

660
00:40:25,581 --> 00:40:25,780
Oh!

661
00:40:25,781 --> 00:40:25,860
Oh!

662
00:40:26,020 --> 00:40:26,380
Oh!

663
00:40:26,381 --> 00:40:27,381
Oh!

664
00:40:30,110 --> 00:40:30,230
Oh!

665
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:30,230
Oh!

666
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:30,230
Oh!

667
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:30,230
Oh!

668
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:30,230
Oh!

669
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:30,230
Oh!

670
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:30,230
Oh!

671
00:40:30,430 --> 00:40:34,670
It... it felt so... good.

672
00:40:43,830 --> 00:40:44,830
Sasuke!

673
00:40:56,660 --> 00:40:57,860
You're nothing.

674
00:40:58,260 --> 00:40:59,840
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

675
00:41:04,640 --> 00:41:06,700
Oh, Shadow Clones.

676
00:41:07,200 --> 00:41:09,280
And there's quite a few of them.

677
00:41:10,700 --> 00:41:11,800
Here we go!

678
00:41:18,100 --> 00:41:19,100
His

679
00:41:25,290 --> 00:41:26,690
skills are too advanced.

680
00:41:30,330 --> 00:41:31,610
I'm not giving up!

681
00:41:31,690 --> 00:41:32,750
I've still got this!

682
00:41:34,970 --> 00:41:35,970
Sasuke!

683
00:41:39,710 --> 00:41:41,350
So that was your plan.

684
00:41:41,830 --> 00:41:43,310
Not bad, Naruto.

685
00:41:54,310 --> 00:41:55,630
You got me.

686
00:41:55,631 --> 00:41:56,690
Demon Wind Shuriken!

687
00:41:57,270 --> 00:41:58,510
A shuriken?

688
00:41:58,850 --> 00:42:00,790
He'll never touch me with that.

689
00:42:02,630 --> 00:42:03,950
Oh, that hurts!

690
00:42:05,350 --> 00:42:06,350
Ooh!

691
00:42:09,590 --> 00:42:14,170
I passed the clone and
aimed for my real body... smart.

692
00:42:14,171 --> 00:42:17,370
Smart... but not smart enough.

693
00:42:19,950 --> 00:42:23,230
A second shuriken in the shadow of the
first.

694
00:42:27,950 --> 00:42:31,330
I told you a shuriken can't touch me.

695
00:42:35,770 --> 00:42:36,770
What?

696
00:42:37,310 --> 00:42:38,410
Eat this!

697
00:42:50,450 --> 00:42:52,370
I'll destroy you!

698
00:43:01,574 --> 00:43:03,220
Kakashi-sensei!

699
00:43:07,875 --> 00:43:10,520
Naruto, that was an excellent plan.

700
00:43:11,650 --> 00:43:13,940
You've really grown, haven't you?

701
00:43:15,820 --> 00:43:18,300
I knew I couldn't beat him with my shadow
clones.

702
00:43:18,480 --> 00:43:20,140
That was just to distract him.

703
00:43:20,260 --> 00:43:23,240
Well, he fought the clones I turned into
the demon when shuriken.

704
00:43:23,650 --> 00:43:25,380
He didn't know what to do, believe it!

705
00:43:25,740 --> 00:43:27,300
Don't brag, you just lucked out.

706
00:43:27,815 --> 00:43:29,740
The whole thing was just a fluke!

707
00:43:30,480 --> 00:43:33,300
You can call it a fluke, but their
teamwork was flawless.

708
00:43:33,500 --> 00:43:36,060
They knew what to do without even talking
about it.

709
00:43:36,120 --> 00:43:40,761
Most of the time they act like they hate
each other, and yet they're a perfect team.

710
00:43:41,240 --> 00:43:44,420
I got distracted and lost my grip on the
water prison.

711
00:43:44,421 --> 00:43:46,460
Don't flatter yourself.

712
00:43:47,675 --> 00:43:50,540
You weren't distracted, you were forced to
let go.

713
00:43:52,160 --> 00:43:56,280
Your technique worked on me once,
but it won't work again.

714
00:43:56,840 --> 00:43:59,040
So, what's it gonna be?

715
00:44:14,060 --> 00:44:15,460
Ok,

716
00:44:30,500 --> 00:44:33,140
I think I'm gonna get the dagger in order
to forgive from Dmayın...

717
00:44:39,140 --> 00:44:40,700
You don't want it from me?

718
00:44:40,701 --> 00:44:40,720
No, I'm trying!

719
00:44:40,721 --> 00:44:40,780
Still no one actually appeared,
Dabi.

720
00:44:40,781 --> 00:44:43,421
We all should be in the same boat wait
until the amazement is over.

721
00:44:50,500 --> 00:44:54,560
Oh, so many hand signs and he mirrored
them all perfectly... instantly.

722
00:45:09,170 --> 00:45:10,670
Something isn't right.

723
00:45:11,010 --> 00:45:13,210
Two sewer cards simultaneously.

724
00:45:23,610 --> 00:45:30,870
Could he... My movements...

725
00:45:38,760 --> 00:45:43,380
It's as if... it's as if he knows what I'm
going to do next.

726
00:45:44,040 --> 00:45:45,040
What?

727
00:45:45,520 --> 00:45:47,940
Is he reading my mind as well?

728
00:45:50,860 --> 00:45:53,080
He looks at me with that eye.

729
00:45:54,060 --> 00:45:56,760
It makes you furious, doesn't it?

730
00:46:01,575 --> 00:46:04,440
All you're doing is copying me.

731
00:46:04,730 --> 00:46:05,730
Like a monkey.

732
00:46:06,330 --> 00:46:08,300
You can't beat me with cheap tricks.

733
00:46:08,520 --> 00:46:09,820
I'll crush you!

734
00:46:10,380 --> 00:46:14,720
When I finish with you, you'll never open
that monkey mouth again!

735
00:46:19,440 --> 00:46:21,260
What is that?

736
00:46:24,300 --> 00:46:25,420
It's me.

737
00:46:26,160 --> 00:46:27,420
But how?

738
00:46:27,720 --> 00:46:29,720
Is it his illusion jutsu?

739
00:46:34,240 --> 00:46:35,020
Water style.

740
00:46:35,200 --> 00:46:37,100
Giant vortex jutsu.

741
00:46:38,560 --> 00:46:39,560
What?

742
00:46:53,880 --> 00:46:58,080
I was just about to create a vortex,
but he created one first!

743
00:47:02,420 --> 00:47:05,620
He copies my jutsu before I can even do
it!

744
00:47:05,820 --> 00:47:07,300
I can't keep up!

745
00:47:45,800 --> 00:47:47,140
You're finished.

746
00:48:06,700 --> 00:48:07,620
How?

747
00:48:07,621 --> 00:48:10,700
Can you... see into the future?

748
00:48:11,240 --> 00:48:12,240
Yes.

749
00:48:13,240 --> 00:48:15,640
This is your last battle... ever.

750
00:48:16,860 --> 00:48:22,640
Ever-ever.

751
00:48:39,390 --> 00:48:40,970
You were right.

752
00:48:41,590 --> 00:48:42,770
It was his last battle.

753
00:49:16,884 --> 00:49:18,480
No vital signs.

754
00:49:22,800 --> 00:49:24,240
Thank you.

755
00:49:25,510 --> 00:49:28,778
I've been tracking
Zabuza for a long time,

756
00:49:28,779 --> 00:49:33,001
waiting for this chance
to finally take him down.

757
00:49:34,650 --> 00:49:39,420
By your mask, I see that you're a tracker
ninja from the village hidden in the mist.

758
00:49:41,000 --> 00:49:42,000
Impressive.

759
00:49:42,480 --> 00:49:43,440
You're well informed.

760
00:49:43,441 --> 00:49:48,680
From his size and voice, he must be the
same age as Naruto.

761
00:49:50,110 --> 00:49:51,580
Yet he's an elite assassin.

762
00:49:58,740 --> 00:50:00,820
He's no ordinary kid.

763
00:50:01,200 --> 00:50:02,740
But what is he?

764
00:50:13,040 --> 00:50:14,660
What is this?

765
00:50:15,400 --> 00:50:17,100
Who do you think you are?

766
00:50:24,320 --> 00:50:24,940
Huh?

767
00:50:24,941 --> 00:50:26,020
Did you hear me?

768
00:50:27,305 --> 00:50:28,305
Easy Naruto.

769
00:50:28,680 --> 00:50:30,000
He's not our enemy.

770
00:50:30,319 --> 00:50:32,400
Huh, that's not the point.

771
00:50:32,500 --> 00:50:34,480
Did you see what he did just like that?

772
00:50:35,400 --> 00:50:39,140
Zabuza was huge and powerful like some
kind of monster.

773
00:50:39,420 --> 00:50:42,200
And this kid who's no bigger than me.

774
00:50:42,320 --> 00:50:46,180
He brought down Zabuza with one move like
it was nothing.

775
00:50:46,340 --> 00:50:48,140
How can I accept that?

776
00:50:50,180 --> 00:50:53,340
Well, even if you don't accept it.

777
00:50:54,000 --> 00:50:57,120
Still, it did happen, Naruto.

778
00:51:01,240 --> 00:51:05,260
In this world, there are kids who are
younger than you.

779
00:51:06,100 --> 00:51:09,340
And yet, stronger than me.

780
00:51:30,120 --> 00:51:32,000
Your struggle is over for now.

781
00:51:32,260 --> 00:51:33,760
I must deal with the remains.

782
00:51:35,340 --> 00:51:37,380
There are many secrets in this body.

783
00:51:37,820 --> 00:51:40,580
They must not be allowed to get into the
wrong hands.

784
00:51:41,720 --> 00:51:43,000
Please excuse me.

785
00:51:43,780 --> 00:51:44,780
Farewell.

786
00:51:48,140 --> 00:51:49,180
He disappeared!

787
00:51:54,835 --> 00:51:56,260
We haven't completed the mission yet.

788
00:51:56,261 --> 00:51:57,666
We haven't completed our mission yet.

789
00:51:57,690 --> 00:52:00,940
We still have to get the bridge builder to
his bridge.

790
00:52:03,180 --> 00:52:05,700
Sorry I caused all this trouble for you.

791
00:52:06,070 --> 00:52:08,780
But you can rest in my house when we get
to the village.

792
00:52:09,360 --> 00:52:10,360
All right.

793
00:52:10,695 --> 00:52:11,695
Let's get a move on.

794
00:52:21,880 --> 00:52:22,880
What?

795
00:52:24,020 --> 00:52:25,020
What happened?

796
00:52:27,060 --> 00:52:28,100
Kakashi-sensei!

797
00:52:36,200 --> 00:52:37,240
Kakashi-sensei!

798
00:52:49,750 --> 00:52:52,490
I think I overdid it with my Sharingan.

799
00:52:55,160 --> 00:52:56,160
Waking up, huh?

800
00:52:56,290 --> 00:52:57,290
Are you all right?

801
00:52:57,820 --> 00:52:58,820
I've been better.

802
00:52:59,590 --> 00:53:01,930
It'll be a week before I can move
normally.

803
00:53:02,290 --> 00:53:03,290
See?

804
00:53:03,760 --> 00:53:05,070
It's better if you don't move.

805
00:53:05,230 --> 00:53:06,230
So just lie down.

806
00:53:07,490 --> 00:53:08,490
Right.

807
00:53:12,130 --> 00:53:14,170
Look, the sensei is coming around!

808
00:53:14,610 --> 00:53:15,790
Listen, sensei.

809
00:53:15,791 --> 00:53:17,890
Your Sharingan is amazing and everything.

810
00:53:18,395 --> 00:53:21,730
But if it puts that much strain on you,
maybe it's not worth it.

811
00:53:21,870 --> 00:53:22,870
Sorry.

812
00:53:24,430 --> 00:53:27,012
Well, he did take down
one of the most powerful

813
00:53:27,013 --> 00:53:30,011
ninja assassins, so
we'll be safe for a while.

814
00:53:30,130 --> 00:53:32,890
Right, but... you know that boy with the
mask?

815
00:53:33,130 --> 00:53:33,910
What about him?

816
00:53:33,911 --> 00:53:37,690
He's from the elite tracking unit of the
village hidden in the mist.

817
00:53:38,075 --> 00:53:40,630
Those masks are only worn by the most
elite shinobi.

818
00:53:41,570 --> 00:53:43,170
What exactly do they do?

819
00:53:43,530 --> 00:53:46,840
The Anbu Black Ops,
also known as the Inferno

820
00:53:46,841 --> 00:53:49,950
Squad, destroy all traces
of a rogue ninja's corpse.

821
00:53:50,570 --> 00:53:54,615
The shinobi's body contains
many secrets, ninjutsu,

822
00:53:54,616 --> 00:53:57,490
chakra, special medicines
used on his body.

823
00:53:57,670 --> 00:53:59,650
These are the secrets of his village.

824
00:53:59,690 --> 00:54:02,930
If his enemies find them, his people will
be in grave danger.

825
00:54:02,931 --> 00:54:06,193
For instance, if I were
to die at the hands of

826
00:54:06,194 --> 00:54:09,571
an enemy, he would try
to analyze my Sharingan.

827
00:54:10,390 --> 00:54:15,430
In the worst case, my entire jutsu could be
stolen and used against our home village.

828
00:54:15,770 --> 00:54:18,824
It is the sacred duty of
the shinobi trackers to

829
00:54:18,825 --> 00:54:21,350
prevent this, to keep
the village's secrets safe.

830
00:54:21,650 --> 00:54:25,950
If a ninja betrays his village,
the trackers hunt him down, eliminate him,

831
00:54:26,070 --> 00:54:28,110
and obliterate every trace of his
existence.

832
00:54:28,690 --> 00:54:29,750
That's their specialty.

833
00:54:32,170 --> 00:54:33,170
What is this?

834
00:54:34,850 --> 00:54:35,850
Something's wrong.

835
00:54:38,190 --> 00:54:40,170
It's like I missed something.

836
00:54:41,510 --> 00:54:43,030
Hey, are you okay?

837
00:54:43,799 --> 00:54:44,799
Sensei?

838
00:54:45,250 --> 00:54:48,011
Tracker ninja deal with
the body immediately,

839
00:54:48,012 --> 00:54:50,651
on the spot, so there's
no room for error.

840
00:54:50,760 --> 00:54:52,030
Is that really important?

841
00:54:52,690 --> 00:54:53,710
Think about it.

842
00:54:54,210 --> 00:54:56,790
Do you remember what that tracker did with
Zabuza's body?

843
00:54:59,390 --> 00:55:01,070
We don't know what he did.

844
00:55:01,071 --> 00:55:03,390
I mean, I guess he took it away somewhere.

845
00:55:05,270 --> 00:55:05,790
Exactly.

846
00:55:05,910 --> 00:55:06,910
But why?

847
00:55:07,050 --> 00:55:10,850
He should have worked on Zabuza right
there, as quickly as possible.

848
00:55:12,030 --> 00:55:14,770
Think of the weapons he used for the
takedown.

849
00:55:15,370 --> 00:55:16,970
Do you remember what they were?

850
00:55:19,690 --> 00:55:20,690
Throwing needles.

851
00:55:21,370 --> 00:55:22,370
No way.

852
00:55:22,850 --> 00:55:23,850
Exactly.

853
00:55:24,090 --> 00:55:25,470
None of it adds up.

854
00:55:26,010 --> 00:55:27,010
Huh.

855
00:55:27,690 --> 00:55:29,250
What are you all yammering about?

856
00:55:29,370 --> 00:55:30,730
You demolished that assassin.

857
00:55:31,570 --> 00:55:32,610
Here's the truth.

858
00:55:33,125 --> 00:55:34,230
Zabuza's still alive.

859
00:55:35,650 --> 00:55:37,810
But we saw his body!

860
00:55:37,930 --> 00:55:38,570
Believe it!

861
00:55:38,830 --> 00:55:40,830
Kakashi-sensei, you checked him yourself!

862
00:55:41,070 --> 00:55:42,350
You said that his heart stopped!

863
00:55:42,690 --> 00:55:43,790
His heart did stop.

864
00:55:44,710 --> 00:55:49,250
But... that was just a temporary state,
to simulate death.

865
00:55:49,790 --> 00:55:52,750
The weapons that tracker used are called
senbon.

866
00:55:52,950 --> 00:55:56,790
They can pierce deeply, but rarely kill
unless they hit a vital organ.

867
00:55:57,070 --> 00:55:58,450
Not in the neck.

868
00:55:58,451 --> 00:56:03,110
They're modified from needles used for
medical treatments, like acupuncture.

869
00:56:03,650 --> 00:56:06,790
Trackers are trained to know every detail
of the human body.

870
00:56:07,030 --> 00:56:09,535
Causing the heart to
stop temporarily while

871
00:56:09,536 --> 00:56:12,491
keeping the body alive
is an easy matter for them.

872
00:56:12,990 --> 00:56:18,210
First, he carried Zabuza's body away,
even though it's much heavier than he is.

873
00:56:18,990 --> 00:56:24,130
Second, he used senbon, which have a
precise effect, but are rarely fatal.

874
00:56:25,150 --> 00:56:28,430
From these two factors, we can conclude
that the tracker is still alive.

875
00:56:28,431 --> 00:56:30,390
The tracker wasn't trying to destroy
Zabuza.

876
00:56:30,570 --> 00:56:32,170
He was trying to save him.

877
00:56:33,200 --> 00:56:35,310
Come on, you're overthinking this,
aren't you?

878
00:56:35,930 --> 00:56:38,710
Encountering suspicion, the ninja prepares
quickly.

879
00:56:39,290 --> 00:56:40,950
Hesitation leads to disaster.

880
00:56:41,470 --> 00:56:43,590
Every shinobi knows this saying.

881
00:56:49,210 --> 00:56:51,750
He's actually pleased to hear Zabuza's
alive.

882
00:56:52,150 --> 00:56:54,670
Now Naruto's got another shot at him.

883
00:56:55,030 --> 00:56:57,270
Sensei, you said prepare quickly.

884
00:56:57,271 --> 00:56:59,950
But how can we do that when you can barely
move?

885
00:57:00,790 --> 00:57:02,210
I can still train you.

886
00:57:02,890 --> 00:57:03,890
Hold on!

887
00:57:03,970 --> 00:57:07,730
A little last-minute training won't make
us strong enough to fight Zabuza!

888
00:57:08,525 --> 00:57:11,050
You could barely defeat him, even with
your Sharingan!

889
00:57:11,250 --> 00:57:13,170
We have to be reasonable about this!

890
00:57:13,370 --> 00:57:15,050
What, are you trying to get us killed?

891
00:57:15,350 --> 00:57:19,490
Sakura, why was I able to stop Zabuza?

892
00:57:20,350 --> 00:57:22,530
Because you all helped me.

893
00:57:22,780 --> 00:57:23,780
You've grown.

894
00:57:24,630 --> 00:57:25,190
Naruto.

895
00:57:25,590 --> 00:57:26,590
Huh?

896
00:57:26,645 --> 00:57:28,110
You've grown the most.

897
00:57:30,390 --> 00:57:32,710
So you noticed, Kakashi-sensei!

898
00:57:32,711 --> 00:57:35,070
Now things are going to get better,
believe it!

899
00:57:35,315 --> 00:57:37,610
I don't believe it, and nothing's going to
be good!

900
00:57:43,040 --> 00:57:44,110
Who are you?

901
00:57:46,050 --> 00:57:47,490
Inari, where have you been?

902
00:57:47,750 --> 00:57:48,770
Welcome back, Grandpa!

903
00:57:50,410 --> 00:57:51,990
Inari, that was very rude.

904
00:57:52,290 --> 00:57:55,490
These ninja helped your Grandpa and
brought him here safely.

905
00:57:55,491 --> 00:57:57,110
It's okay, it's okay.

906
00:57:57,290 --> 00:57:58,330
I'm rude to them, too.

907
00:58:00,190 --> 00:58:01,890
Mom, don't you see?

908
00:58:01,930 --> 00:58:03,130
These people are going to die!

909
00:58:03,310 --> 00:58:06,010
Gato and his men will come back and find
them and wipe them out!

910
00:58:06,270 --> 00:58:07,450
What did you say, brat?

911
00:58:08,204 --> 00:58:09,150
Listen up!

912
00:58:09,151 --> 00:58:10,550
You know what a super ninja is?

913
00:58:10,730 --> 00:58:12,610
Well, that's me, only a lot better!

914
00:58:12,730 --> 00:58:14,070
I'm going to be Hokage!

915
00:58:14,430 --> 00:58:19,891
This Gato or Blotto or whatever he's
called is no match for a real hero like me!

916
00:58:19,950 --> 00:58:22,130
Huh, there's no such thing as a hero.

917
00:58:22,750 --> 00:58:24,450
You're just full of stupid ideas!

918
00:58:24,451 --> 00:58:25,850
What'd you say?

919
00:58:26,090 --> 00:58:27,310
Naruto, calm down!

920
00:58:27,530 --> 00:58:30,570
If you want to stay alive, you should go
back where you came from.

921
00:58:32,550 --> 00:58:34,310
Inari, wait, where are you going?

922
00:58:35,670 --> 00:58:37,110
To look out at the ocean.

923
00:58:37,410 --> 00:58:38,410
I want to be alone.

924
00:58:42,879 --> 00:58:44,210
Sorry about that.

925
00:58:46,890 --> 00:58:48,710
Who does that brat think he is?

926
00:58:48,850 --> 00:58:50,830
I'm going to put him in his place right
now!

927
00:58:56,089 --> 00:58:57,089
Huh?

928
00:58:58,680 --> 00:58:59,680
He's crying?

929
00:59:09,440 --> 00:59:10,860
No, Daddy, no!

930
00:59:18,080 --> 00:59:20,860
All right, training starts now.

931
00:59:21,600 --> 00:59:22,600
Right!

932
00:59:22,760 --> 00:59:26,100
First, we will begin with a review of
Chakra, the ninja.

933
00:59:26,101 --> 00:59:27,776
Chakra is a ninja's basic source of power.

934
00:59:27,800 --> 00:59:29,620
Understanding Chakra is essential.

935
00:59:29,940 --> 00:59:30,940
We know that.

936
00:59:31,240 --> 00:59:32,240
He's right.

937
00:59:32,420 --> 00:59:35,420
A long time ago, we learned about,
uh, Catra.

938
00:59:35,800 --> 00:59:36,800
Chakra?

939
00:59:37,940 --> 00:59:39,340
Go ahead, Sakura.

940
00:59:39,780 --> 00:59:40,780
All right, Naruto.

941
00:59:42,760 --> 00:59:46,520
Chakra is the elemental life energy a
ninja uses in Jutsu.

942
00:59:46,560 --> 00:59:48,260
It's the source of all his power.

943
00:59:48,580 --> 00:59:50,480
Now, this energy has two forms.

944
00:59:50,520 --> 00:59:52,759
Physical energy, which
exists in all the cells

945
00:59:52,760 --> 00:59:54,640
in the entire body,
all working together.

946
00:59:54,641 --> 00:59:58,329
And, spiritual energy,
the primal source of power

947
00:59:58,330 --> 01:00:01,280
which is intensified through
training and experience.

948
01:00:01,840 --> 01:00:04,441
As you see, these two types
of Chakra must be drawn

949
01:00:04,442 --> 01:00:07,220
out and brought together
in order to perform Jutsu.

950
01:00:08,000 --> 01:00:11,180
Notice the interplay between physical and
spiritual power.

951
01:00:11,620 --> 01:00:12,740
That's the key.

952
01:00:13,540 --> 01:00:14,880
Finally, hand signs.

953
01:00:15,200 --> 01:00:16,900
Focus and unleash the Chakra.

954
01:00:17,440 --> 01:00:19,200
Right on all points.

955
01:00:19,460 --> 01:00:22,400
Iruka-sensei really did have some
excellent students.

956
01:00:22,960 --> 01:00:23,960
Huh!

957
01:00:24,520 --> 01:00:27,440
What's the big deal with all these
complicated explanations?

958
01:00:27,940 --> 01:00:30,360
The whole point is to learn the Jutsu,
isn't it?

959
01:00:30,600 --> 01:00:31,820
Naruto's right for once.

960
01:00:32,200 --> 01:00:34,960
We're already using Chakra energy in our
Jutsu.

961
01:00:35,120 --> 01:00:35,560
No.

962
01:00:35,840 --> 01:00:37,660
You have not mastered this power.

963
01:00:37,800 --> 01:00:39,620
You've barely scratched the surface of it.

964
01:00:39,760 --> 01:00:40,760
What do you mean?

965
01:00:41,565 --> 01:00:42,740
Calm down and listen.

966
01:00:43,200 --> 01:00:44,580
It's just like Sakura said.

967
01:00:45,170 --> 01:00:47,425
You have to draw on
physical and spiritual

968
01:00:47,426 --> 01:00:50,761
energies and then combine
them within yourself.

969
01:00:50,860 --> 01:00:52,540
But, how do you do that?

970
01:00:53,320 --> 01:00:57,820
Each Jutsu requires different types of
Chakra in different proportions.

971
01:00:58,260 --> 01:01:01,700
You must select and combine them in
exactly the right way.

972
01:01:02,040 --> 01:01:06,300
Up to now, you've just guessed at the
proportions, hoping they'd come out right.

973
01:01:06,560 --> 01:01:09,441
Even if you produce a
lot of Chakra, unless you

974
01:01:09,461 --> 01:01:12,060
can balance and control
it, it's all worthless.

975
01:01:12,900 --> 01:01:16,560
The Jutsu won't work at all, or it'll just
be a joke.

976
01:01:18,380 --> 01:01:21,200
You waste so much energy that way.

977
01:01:21,201 --> 01:01:24,320
Then you're out of Chakra and you can't
fight at all.

978
01:01:24,480 --> 01:01:25,720
You're just a target.

979
01:01:26,080 --> 01:01:28,280
Uh, so how do we change that?

980
01:01:29,120 --> 01:01:32,860
Train so hard that controlling your Chakra
becomes second nature.

981
01:01:32,980 --> 01:01:37,020
To achieve this goal, you must be ready to
put your life on the line.

982
01:01:39,040 --> 01:01:41,020
What do we have to do?

983
01:01:42,940 --> 01:01:43,940
Climb a tree.

984
01:01:44,880 --> 01:01:45,880
Climb a tree?

985
01:01:46,120 --> 01:01:47,120
That's right.

986
01:01:47,400 --> 01:01:49,680
But there's just one rule.

987
01:01:49,681 --> 01:01:51,420
No hands.

988
01:01:51,960 --> 01:01:52,720
What?

989
01:01:52,980 --> 01:01:53,980
You're kidding.

990
01:01:55,460 --> 01:01:56,460
Am I?

991
01:01:56,960 --> 01:01:57,960
Let's see.

992
01:02:13,880 --> 01:02:15,100
He's climbing!

993
01:02:16,030 --> 01:02:17,100
Straight up!

994
01:02:17,120 --> 01:02:18,600
And he's only using his feet!

995
01:02:21,730 --> 01:02:23,240
Well, you get the idea.

996
01:02:24,570 --> 01:02:28,820
Focus the Chakra toward the soles of your
feet and use it to connect to the tree.

997
01:02:29,450 --> 01:02:31,700
This is one way to apply the power of
Chakra.

998
01:02:32,040 --> 01:02:33,040
Wait a minute!

999
01:02:33,510 --> 01:02:35,860
That's a nice trick, but how does it help
us fight Zabuza?

1000
01:02:36,430 --> 01:02:38,200
It's the only way to fight him,
Sakura.

1001
01:02:38,850 --> 01:02:40,780
That's the entire goal of this training.

1002
01:02:41,660 --> 01:02:44,418
First, you'll learn to
draw a precise amount

1003
01:02:44,419 --> 01:02:46,560
of Chakra to a precise
point in your body.

1004
01:02:46,860 --> 01:02:49,320
This is difficult even for advanced ninja.

1005
01:02:49,321 --> 01:02:54,240
This type of climbing requires a subtle
mix of physical and spiritual energy.

1006
01:02:54,460 --> 01:02:58,680
And the bottoms of the feet are the most
difficult points to focus Chakra.

1007
01:02:59,000 --> 01:03:00,540
Are you getting the picture?

1008
01:03:01,060 --> 01:03:05,100
If you can master this, you'll be able to
master any Jutsu.

1009
01:03:06,220 --> 01:03:07,420
Well, theoretically.

1010
01:03:08,960 --> 01:03:12,340
The second point is to learn to maintain
your Chakra levels.

1011
01:03:12,580 --> 01:03:14,960
When a ninja is focused
in battle, it's even

1012
01:03:14,961 --> 01:03:17,360
harder to control and
maintain his Chakra levels.

1013
01:03:17,480 --> 01:03:18,640
A deadly mistake.

1014
01:03:19,320 --> 01:03:23,940
To avoid this, maintaining Chakra must
become second nature, effortless.

1015
01:03:24,590 --> 01:03:28,800
Well, I can talk about this all day, but
that won't advance your skills, will it?

1016
01:03:28,950 --> 01:03:32,020
You need to apply the power of Chakra
through training.

1017
01:03:35,200 --> 01:03:38,408
Use the kunai knife to
mark the tree at the highest

1018
01:03:38,409 --> 01:03:41,820
point you can climb
without using your hands.

1019
01:03:42,240 --> 01:03:46,680
Then try to get past that mark the next
time and the next.

1020
01:03:48,160 --> 01:03:50,439
At first, you'll need
to run at the tree so

1021
01:03:50,440 --> 01:03:52,860
your momentum can take
you as high as possible.

1022
01:03:53,220 --> 01:03:54,620
Until you get used to it.

1023
01:03:56,720 --> 01:03:57,880
I'm more than ready!

1024
01:03:57,960 --> 01:04:00,140
This is gonna be no sweat all the way!

1025
01:04:00,220 --> 01:04:01,220
Believe it!

1026
01:04:01,820 --> 01:04:03,620
Remember what you said, Sensei!

1027
01:04:03,640 --> 01:04:05,040
I'm the one who's grown the most!

1028
01:04:05,180 --> 01:04:07,360
You're definitely the one who talks the
most.

1029
01:04:07,500 --> 01:04:09,020
Now get focused and do it!

1030
01:04:09,220 --> 01:04:10,460
Well, he did say that.

1031
01:04:11,680 --> 01:04:12,120
Okay.

1032
01:04:12,121 --> 01:04:15,260
First, I need to draw the Chakra to the
bottom of my feet.

1033
01:04:16,220 --> 01:04:17,220
Okay.

1034
01:04:22,730 --> 01:04:22,730
First, I need to draw the Chakra to the
bottom of my feet.

1035
01:04:22,750 --> 01:04:24,110
I got it!

1036
01:04:25,150 --> 01:04:26,150
Charge!

1037
01:04:41,270 --> 01:04:43,230
This is harder than I thought.

1038
01:04:43,450 --> 01:04:45,150
The balance has to be perfect.

1039
01:04:45,490 --> 01:04:48,990
If the Chakra's too strong, it smashes the
tree and pushes you off.

1040
01:04:50,850 --> 01:04:53,810
But if it's not strong enough...
You just tumble back down.

1041
01:04:54,030 --> 01:04:55,030
Like Naruto.

1042
01:04:58,250 --> 01:05:00,230
That's about what I expected from Sasuke.

1043
01:05:00,510 --> 01:05:01,550
And Naruto.

1044
01:05:02,090 --> 01:05:03,450
Hey, this is fun!

1045
01:05:06,570 --> 01:05:07,570
Sakura!

1046
01:05:13,250 --> 01:05:13,810
Yeah!

1047
01:05:14,130 --> 01:05:15,250
Way to go, Sakura!

1048
01:05:15,370 --> 01:05:16,710
I always knew you were awesome!

1049
01:05:16,770 --> 01:05:17,370
Believe it!

1050
01:05:17,510 --> 01:05:19,550
It does sort of tick me off, though.

1051
01:05:20,290 --> 01:05:20,850
Whatever.

1052
01:05:20,851 --> 01:05:22,970
I thought Sasuke would be impressed.

1053
01:05:23,190 --> 01:05:24,530
Now he's mad at me.

1054
01:05:24,650 --> 01:05:26,350
Why is it always like that?

1055
01:05:26,790 --> 01:05:29,813
Well, not only does
Sakura understand Chakra,

1056
01:05:29,814 --> 01:05:32,250
she can control and
maintain it as well.

1057
01:05:32,410 --> 01:05:36,090
We spoke about someone becoming Hokage one
day, didn't we?

1058
01:05:36,430 --> 01:05:39,850
Seems Sakura's got the best chance of
that, wouldn't you say?

1059
01:05:40,050 --> 01:05:44,370
And as for the great Uchiha clan,
maybe they're not so great after all.

1060
01:05:44,550 --> 01:05:45,790
Shut up, Sensei!

1061
01:05:45,791 --> 01:05:46,791
You talk too much!

1062
01:05:47,490 --> 01:05:48,930
Sasuke's gonna hate me now!

1063
01:05:52,320 --> 01:05:52,840
All right.

1064
01:05:53,040 --> 01:05:54,140
I think they're motivated.

1065
01:05:54,725 --> 01:05:58,120
Of course, Naruto and Sasuke both have far
more Chakra within.

1066
01:05:58,540 --> 01:06:03,400
If this training works, their mastery of
Chakra will become a valuable asset.

1067
01:06:05,100 --> 01:06:06,100
All right!

1068
01:06:06,690 --> 01:06:07,740
First I'll match Sasuke!

1069
01:06:08,860 --> 01:06:10,720
Then I'm going all the way to the top!

1070
01:06:10,870 --> 01:06:11,870
Believe it!

1071
01:06:15,060 --> 01:06:16,060
Huh.

1072
01:06:16,700 --> 01:06:18,140
What a waste of time.

1073
01:06:18,675 --> 01:06:20,275
They don't know what they're up against.

1074
01:06:20,740 --> 01:06:21,740
Hmm.

1075
01:06:46,890 --> 01:06:48,430
I'm totally worn out.

1076
01:06:48,570 --> 01:06:50,870
How can they just keep going like that?

1077
01:06:51,470 --> 01:06:52,470
Ow!

1078
01:06:54,130 --> 01:06:55,130
Hah!

1079
01:06:57,590 --> 01:07:00,370
Naruto isn't making any progress at all.

1080
01:07:00,371 --> 01:07:04,150
Knowing him, any minute now he'll give up
and throw a tantrum.

1081
01:07:06,170 --> 01:07:06,490
Ah!

1082
01:07:07,150 --> 01:07:08,150
There he goes.

1083
01:07:08,250 --> 01:07:10,470
He's so predictable, it's embarrassing.

1084
01:07:10,950 --> 01:07:11,490
Hmm?

1085
01:07:11,919 --> 01:07:15,030
Uh, uh... Hey, you're good at this.

1086
01:07:15,260 --> 01:07:16,260
How about some advice?

1087
01:07:16,410 --> 01:07:19,150
Uh... But please don't
tell Sasuke I asked.

1088
01:07:19,250 --> 01:07:20,290
Please, please!

1089
01:07:22,250 --> 01:07:23,570
He's catching on.

1090
01:07:24,030 --> 01:07:26,870
From now on, he'll get stronger and
stronger.

1091
01:07:26,871 --> 01:07:27,871
Stronger?

1092
01:07:28,550 --> 01:07:29,730
How strong?

1093
01:07:30,510 --> 01:07:34,610
After all, Naruto possesses more Chakra
than Sasuke.

1094
01:07:35,510 --> 01:07:41,270
In fact, the amount of Chakra he possesses
is greater than my own.

1095
01:08:05,890 --> 01:08:07,870
You always this lazy?

1096
01:08:10,710 --> 01:08:13,670
Where's that weird blonde kid and the one
with the attitude?

1097
01:08:14,505 --> 01:08:15,790
They're training, climbing trees.

1098
01:08:15,791 --> 01:08:17,390
Too tough for you?

1099
01:08:18,000 --> 01:08:19,990
No, in fact, I'm the best.

1100
01:08:20,170 --> 01:08:22,710
That's why the sensei sent me here to
guard you.

1101
01:08:24,250 --> 01:08:25,250
You're joking.

1102
01:08:26,710 --> 01:08:27,710
Waaaaah!

1103
01:08:29,490 --> 01:08:31,810
Tatsuno, uh, I need to talk to you.

1104
01:08:33,029 --> 01:08:33,470
Huh?

1105
01:08:33,471 --> 01:08:34,109
What about?

1106
01:08:34,490 --> 01:08:38,270
Uh, thing is, I've been thinking a lot
about the bridge.

1107
01:08:38,910 --> 01:08:42,090
And I decided... I've pushed my luck far
enough.

1108
01:08:42,149 --> 01:08:43,149
I want out.

1109
01:08:43,280 --> 01:08:45,290
Now you're going to quit on me just like
that?

1110
01:08:45,830 --> 01:08:46,830
You're kidding!

1111
01:08:47,670 --> 01:08:50,890
You know, I stayed on because of our
friendship.

1112
01:08:51,149 --> 01:08:54,290
But I'm putting my life on the line every
day I stay here.

1113
01:08:54,430 --> 01:08:56,149
Gato and his thugs will show up
eventually.

1114
01:08:56,470 --> 01:09:00,229
When they do, they'll kill you and the
bridge will never get finished anyway.

1115
01:09:01,810 --> 01:09:03,490
It's a lost cause, Tazuna.

1116
01:09:03,689 --> 01:09:06,649
Why don't we stop now while we can still
get out of this alive?

1117
01:09:09,330 --> 01:09:11,029
This is our bridge.

1118
01:09:12,050 --> 01:09:13,630
Our island is poor.

1119
01:09:13,631 --> 01:09:17,410
And it will stay that way until this
bridge connects us to the mainland.

1120
01:09:17,950 --> 01:09:19,670
Commerce, trade, and hope.

1121
01:09:19,870 --> 01:09:21,410
That's what we're building here.

1122
01:09:21,649 --> 01:09:23,810
There's not gonna be much hope if we're
all dead.

1123
01:09:24,990 --> 01:09:26,310
It's already noon.

1124
01:09:26,890 --> 01:09:28,270
Let's break for lunch.

1125
01:09:31,029 --> 01:09:33,050
Tazuna, let's not end it like this.

1126
01:09:33,210 --> 01:09:34,210
Save your breath.

1127
01:09:34,310 --> 01:09:39,029
Oh, and Giichi, don't bother coming back
after lunch.

1128
01:09:47,370 --> 01:09:49,810
Why is it so hard?!

1129
01:10:05,780 --> 01:10:08,020
I'm not gonna lose out to you!

1130
01:10:08,200 --> 01:10:08,620
Sorya!

1131
01:10:08,621 --> 01:10:09,621
Sorya!

1132
01:10:13,860 --> 01:10:14,620
Sorya!

1133
01:10:14,621 --> 01:10:15,380
Sorya!

1134
01:10:15,381 --> 01:10:15,620
Sorya!

1135
01:10:15,621 --> 01:10:16,621
Sorya!

1136
01:10:17,520 --> 01:10:18,520
Um,

1137
01:10:22,180 --> 01:10:23,380
where are we going?

1138
01:10:23,640 --> 01:10:25,540
You wanna eat tonight, don't ya?

1139
01:10:25,660 --> 01:10:27,520
I gotta pick up some things for dinner.

1140
01:10:29,880 --> 01:10:30,480
Thief!

1141
01:10:30,720 --> 01:10:31,720
Thief!

1142
01:10:38,265 --> 01:10:40,130
What's wrong with these people?

1143
01:10:41,425 --> 01:10:42,450
Here we are.

1144
01:10:45,690 --> 01:10:46,290
Welcome.

1145
01:10:46,450 --> 01:10:47,450
Welcome.

1146
01:10:55,730 --> 01:10:56,730
This is a store?

1147
01:10:56,860 --> 01:10:58,100
There's nothing here.

1148
01:11:04,420 --> 01:11:05,860
You pervert!

1149
01:11:06,980 --> 01:11:09,580
Wow, you really surprised me back there.

1150
01:11:09,780 --> 01:11:11,900
Girls around here don't fight like that.

1151
01:11:12,695 --> 01:11:13,300
They should.

1152
01:11:13,380 --> 01:11:15,200
Something's seriously wrong here.

1153
01:11:16,980 --> 01:11:17,980
Again?

1154
01:11:18,200 --> 01:11:19,240
Hey, buster!

1155
01:11:20,560 --> 01:11:22,281
Uh... Uh...

1156
01:11:23,700 --> 01:11:25,381
Uh... Please?

1157
01:11:27,780 --> 01:11:28,780
Hmm...

1158
01:11:30,660 --> 01:11:31,660
Uh...

1159
01:11:32,320 --> 01:11:33,320
Here.

1160
01:11:35,620 --> 01:11:37,060
Oh, thank you!

1161
01:11:38,380 --> 01:11:39,380
Hmph.

1162
01:11:41,980 --> 01:11:44,980
This is how it's been since Gato came
here.

1163
01:11:45,240 --> 01:11:49,860
The children suffer, and the adults are
afraid to stand up to him.

1164
01:11:54,820 --> 01:11:56,420
They've lost all hope.

1165
01:11:56,680 --> 01:11:58,860
That's why we have to finish the bridge.

1166
01:11:59,500 --> 01:12:01,500
It will bring commerce and trade.

1167
01:12:01,800 --> 01:12:05,000
But much more importantly, that bridge is
a symbol of courage.

1168
01:12:05,200 --> 01:12:08,000
We must restore the spirit of our people.

1169
01:12:10,760 --> 01:12:16,300
When the bridge is finished, people will
start to believe again.

1170
01:12:18,220 --> 01:12:20,640
They'll believe that they can live with
dignity.

1171
01:12:21,800 --> 01:12:24,220
We can't let Gato stop us.

1172
01:12:43,095 --> 01:12:44,580
He's still climbing!

1173
01:12:44,780 --> 01:12:45,780
That's impossible!

1174
01:12:51,800 --> 01:12:52,340
Damn!

1175
01:12:52,600 --> 01:12:54,560
He's catching up to me inch by inch!

1176
01:12:58,180 --> 01:12:59,540
No, no, no!

1177
01:12:59,740 --> 01:13:02,260
If I think about Sasuke, I'll lose my
concentration!

1178
01:13:02,840 --> 01:13:03,840
Believe it!

1179
01:13:04,100 --> 01:13:05,180
Come on, Naruto.

1180
01:13:05,580 --> 01:13:06,580
Relax.

1181
01:13:06,920 --> 01:13:07,920
Focus on the tree.

1182
01:13:08,500 --> 01:13:09,040
Yeah!

1183
01:13:09,320 --> 01:13:10,480
I can feel it!

1184
01:13:10,620 --> 01:13:12,540
I'm going all the way this time!

1185
01:13:12,820 --> 01:13:13,820
Hey, Naruto!

1186
01:13:16,640 --> 01:13:17,640
Sasuke!

1187
01:13:17,670 --> 01:13:18,670
What are you doing?

1188
01:13:19,120 --> 01:13:20,500
I was trying to focus my chakra!

1189
01:13:21,610 --> 01:13:25,240
Well, uh, you know, the thing is...

1190
01:13:25,390 --> 01:13:26,800
The thing is what?

1191
01:13:30,730 --> 01:13:34,260
You, you know, you asked Sakura for advice
when she was here.

1192
01:13:35,240 --> 01:13:36,840
So what did she tell you?

1193
01:13:41,660 --> 01:13:42,660
I'm not telling you.

1194
01:13:54,670 --> 01:13:55,210
I'm not telling you.

1195
01:13:55,211 --> 01:13:56,211
This is fantastic!

1196
01:13:56,490 --> 01:13:59,830
It's been ages since we've had so many
guests around our table.

1197
01:14:05,790 --> 01:14:07,130
I want some more!

1198
01:14:13,310 --> 01:14:15,510
Don't eat so much or you're going to puke
it up!

1199
01:14:16,030 --> 01:14:17,770
I have to eat.

1200
01:14:18,210 --> 01:14:20,330
And I have to eat more than him.

1201
01:14:20,331 --> 01:14:23,430
It's the only possible way I'll get strong
enough to beat him.

1202
01:14:23,750 --> 01:14:27,090
That's true, but puking won't help you.

1203
01:14:34,350 --> 01:14:36,780
Excuse me, this picture is torn.

1204
01:14:37,080 --> 01:14:38,440
Is there some reason for that?

1205
01:14:43,000 --> 01:14:44,000
It's my husband.

1206
01:14:46,410 --> 01:14:48,980
They used to call him a hero in this land.

1207
01:14:58,130 --> 01:15:01,750
Father, you can't talk about him like that
in front of Inari, you know that!

1208
01:15:07,855 --> 01:15:10,580
Inari, so... I mean, what happened to him?

1209
01:15:12,495 --> 01:15:14,440
Is there a story behind this?

1210
01:15:16,120 --> 01:15:17,340
He wasn't his real father.

1211
01:15:17,520 --> 01:15:19,120
He came into our family later.

1212
01:15:20,320 --> 01:15:21,720
And he brought so much happiness.

1213
01:15:21,980 --> 01:15:24,200
He and Inari were very close.

1214
01:15:26,850 --> 01:15:27,850
In those days...

1215
01:15:27,980 --> 01:15:29,920
Inari used to laugh all the time.

1216
01:15:32,530 --> 01:15:33,580
But then...

1217
01:15:34,235 --> 01:15:35,700
All that ended.

1218
01:15:36,140 --> 01:15:38,760
He never laughs or smiles anymore.

1219
01:15:39,720 --> 01:15:42,320
Ever since the day everything changed.

1220
01:15:44,340 --> 01:15:44,940
Poochie!

1221
01:15:44,941 --> 01:15:45,941
Poochie, no!

1222
01:15:48,180 --> 01:15:49,460
That's not his name.

1223
01:15:49,910 --> 01:15:51,960
Starting today, his name is Shooting Star.

1224
01:15:52,690 --> 01:15:53,920
And he's my dog now!

1225
01:15:54,180 --> 01:15:54,820
No, he's not!

1226
01:15:54,900 --> 01:15:55,840
He's my dog!

1227
01:15:55,880 --> 01:15:57,640
And his name's not Shooting Star!

1228
01:15:58,030 --> 01:15:59,440
I've had him since he was a puppy!

1229
01:15:59,540 --> 01:16:01,800
He's my friend and he doesn't belong to
you!

1230
01:16:03,890 --> 01:16:04,890
Just shut up!

1231
01:16:11,960 --> 01:16:12,960
Poochie!

1232
01:16:15,820 --> 01:16:18,040
See what happens when you don't listen to
me?

1233
01:16:19,080 --> 01:16:21,280
Now I'm not going to lift a finger to help
him.

1234
01:16:22,180 --> 01:16:23,480
Okay, you can let him go.

1235
01:16:25,640 --> 01:16:27,020
Why did you do that?

1236
01:16:27,100 --> 01:16:28,260
My dog is going to drown!

1237
01:16:28,920 --> 01:16:29,360
Ha!

1238
01:16:29,760 --> 01:16:32,180
If he's your dog, then jump in and get
him!

1239
01:16:32,280 --> 01:16:34,120
Be a big hero and save your friend!

1240
01:16:36,200 --> 01:16:40,160
After all that big talk, you're not going
to let him go under, are you?

1241
01:16:46,320 --> 01:16:49,040
You won't even help his precious little
Poochie!

1242
01:16:49,400 --> 01:16:51,900
I... I can't swim!

1243
01:16:52,160 --> 01:16:53,200
And I'm scared!

1244
01:16:53,201 --> 01:16:55,200
I'm sorry, Poochie.

1245
01:16:56,420 --> 01:16:59,700
Hey, you made such a big deal about him,
go get him!

1246
01:17:05,500 --> 01:17:07,880
I think you went too far, Akane.

1247
01:17:08,040 --> 01:17:10,100
I mean, he could really drown or
something.

1248
01:17:11,780 --> 01:17:12,780
Help!

1249
01:17:13,000 --> 01:17:13,540
Please!

1250
01:17:13,780 --> 01:17:14,960
Forget about it.

1251
01:17:15,140 --> 01:17:16,140
I don't know.

1252
01:17:17,500 --> 01:17:20,420
You say one more word and you're going in
next!

1253
01:17:20,600 --> 01:17:21,060
Got it?

1254
01:17:21,061 --> 01:17:22,980
I don't want to die!

1255
01:17:26,750 --> 01:17:27,750
Pooch!

1256
01:17:30,850 --> 01:17:31,690
Pooch!

1257
01:17:31,691 --> 01:17:32,691
Pooch!

1258
01:17:39,600 --> 01:17:41,260
He's shooting stars running away!

1259
01:17:41,400 --> 01:17:42,400
Get him!

1260
01:17:48,680 --> 01:17:53,640
Oh no... I can't breathe... I...

1261
01:17:55,160 --> 01:18:02,620
I can't breathe... I can't
breathe... Waking up, huh?

1262
01:18:03,260 --> 01:18:04,260
Finally!

1263
01:18:09,240 --> 01:18:10,720
I had a little talk with those kids.

1264
01:18:10,920 --> 01:18:12,040
They won't bother you again.

1265
01:18:12,820 --> 01:18:13,820
Here, eat.

1266
01:18:14,500 --> 01:18:15,500
Am I alive?

1267
01:18:16,340 --> 01:18:17,340
Is this for real?

1268
01:18:18,620 --> 01:18:20,440
Did you pull me out of the water,
mister?

1269
01:18:21,200 --> 01:18:22,360
Have a bite to eat first.

1270
01:18:22,860 --> 01:18:24,400
Then we can talk all about it.

1271
01:18:26,220 --> 01:18:28,940
I see, your dog abandoned you too,
huh?

1272
01:18:29,200 --> 01:18:31,080
In my country, dogs are very loyal.

1273
01:18:31,240 --> 01:18:32,440
They stand by their masters.

1274
01:18:33,860 --> 01:18:38,480
Then again, you abandoned the dog first,
so what can you expect?

1275
01:18:40,080 --> 01:18:43,200
I really wanted to save him, but I just
froze.

1276
01:18:45,460 --> 01:18:47,400
I was just so scared.

1277
01:18:48,080 --> 01:18:50,540
I guess that I just don't have any
courage.

1278
01:18:50,541 --> 01:18:52,220
Hey, come on.

1279
01:18:52,260 --> 01:18:53,580
Don't be so hard on yourself.

1280
01:18:53,800 --> 01:18:54,380
You're a kid.

1281
01:18:54,600 --> 01:18:56,380
When I was your age, I was scared too.

1282
01:18:57,980 --> 01:18:59,060
It's no big deal.

1283
01:19:00,000 --> 01:19:01,500
But always remember this.

1284
01:19:03,740 --> 01:19:06,200
Live your life so you have nothing to
regret.

1285
01:19:08,540 --> 01:19:11,000
If you care about something, protect it.

1286
01:19:11,040 --> 01:19:14,340
No matter how tough, no matter how sad,
you've got to keep trying.

1287
01:19:14,740 --> 01:19:19,600
Even if you have to put your life on the
line, protect it with both arms.

1288
01:19:19,620 --> 01:19:20,620
Never give in!

1289
01:19:24,860 --> 01:19:26,040
We've got trouble, Kaiser!

1290
01:19:26,300 --> 01:19:28,540
The floodgate's open and the water's
rising!

1291
01:19:28,760 --> 01:19:31,420
If we don't stop, the lower district will
be flooded!

1292
01:19:31,720 --> 01:19:32,720
What?

1293
01:19:32,760 --> 01:19:33,160
Further!

1294
01:19:33,700 --> 01:19:34,900
Inari, get me some rope!

1295
01:19:34,940 --> 01:19:35,280
Hurry!

1296
01:19:35,580 --> 01:19:35,880
Right!

1297
01:19:36,220 --> 01:19:37,360
See where the gate is?

1298
01:19:37,500 --> 01:19:39,640
We need to get a line out there to pull it
closed!

1299
01:19:39,900 --> 01:19:40,580
A line?

1300
01:19:40,600 --> 01:19:42,460
You have to swim out there to do that!

1301
01:19:42,720 --> 01:19:43,720
It's impossible!

1302
01:19:43,760 --> 01:19:45,520
No one can make it through that current!

1303
01:19:45,780 --> 01:19:48,760
If we don't do it, the whole district will
be wiped out!

1304
01:19:49,020 --> 01:19:50,120
It's the only way!

1305
01:19:50,121 --> 01:19:51,280
I'll do it!

1306
01:19:52,700 --> 01:19:53,700
Kaiser!

1307
01:19:55,120 --> 01:19:56,220
Don't be foolish!

1308
01:19:56,580 --> 01:19:57,660
You'll never make it!

1309
01:19:59,020 --> 01:20:00,020
Father!

1310
01:20:00,300 --> 01:20:01,300
Don't worry.

1311
01:20:02,380 --> 01:20:03,960
Nothing can stop your dad.

1312
01:20:04,160 --> 01:20:07,840
This is our village, so we've got to do
everything we can to help.

1313
01:20:11,820 --> 01:20:14,460
If you care about something, protect it.

1314
01:20:15,760 --> 01:20:16,760
No!

1315
01:20:25,180 --> 01:20:26,180
He's gone!

1316
01:20:27,840 --> 01:20:28,400
He's gone!

1317
01:20:28,480 --> 01:20:29,040
He's gone!

1318
01:20:29,041 --> 01:20:29,500
He made it!

1319
01:20:29,580 --> 01:20:30,660
He tied the rope on!

1320
01:20:30,820 --> 01:20:31,060
Alright!

1321
01:20:31,240 --> 01:20:32,240
Let's pull it closed!

1322
01:20:32,480 --> 01:20:33,700
Everybody, come on!

1323
01:20:35,440 --> 01:20:39,960
From that time on, Kaiser was considered a
hero in this land.

1324
01:20:40,160 --> 01:20:44,760
He taught us all the meaning of courage
and Inari was so proud to be his son.

1325
01:20:50,120 --> 01:20:51,120
And took over.

1326
01:20:51,220 --> 01:20:53,260
He terrorized the whole village.

1327
01:20:53,580 --> 01:20:55,440
Only Kaisa stood up to him.

1328
01:20:57,020 --> 01:20:59,880
Gato couldn't have a local hero getting in
his way.

1329
01:21:00,320 --> 01:21:03,400
It took his whole gang to stop one man.

1330
01:21:04,780 --> 01:21:06,540
You overplayed your hand, Kaisa.

1331
01:21:06,720 --> 01:21:07,860
All that talk.

1332
01:21:08,080 --> 01:21:11,080
About how you're going to protect this
village with your two arms.

1333
01:21:11,980 --> 01:21:14,440
Those arms aren't much work now,
are they?

1334
01:21:14,880 --> 01:21:17,200
Still got that defiant look in your eye,
though.

1335
01:21:18,580 --> 01:21:20,680
Well, my men will get rid of that.

1336
01:21:22,760 --> 01:21:24,320
Get to work on him.

1337
01:21:24,400 --> 01:21:25,400
Get down there!

1338
01:21:43,230 --> 01:21:44,350
Listen up!

1339
01:21:44,690 --> 01:21:47,270
This man has defied the Gato Corporation.

1340
01:21:47,750 --> 01:21:49,890
He has disturbed the order of the Kaisa.

1341
01:21:49,910 --> 01:21:51,390
He is the only survivor of this land.

1342
01:21:52,650 --> 01:21:54,670
His punishment is execution.

1343
01:21:58,090 --> 01:22:02,550
Let this be an example so no one will dare
stand in our way again.

1344
01:22:03,130 --> 01:22:04,130
Father!

1345
01:22:04,670 --> 01:22:05,950
Inari, don't!

1346
01:22:10,750 --> 01:22:11,750
Do it.

1347
01:22:15,910 --> 01:22:16,950
Father, no!

1348
01:22:23,190 --> 01:22:24,190
Daddy!

1349
01:22:33,990 --> 01:22:35,670
Since then, Inari's changed.

1350
01:22:36,620 --> 01:22:38,750
So did Tsunami and all our people.

1351
01:22:39,605 --> 01:22:40,810
We lost our will.

1352
01:22:50,810 --> 01:22:52,760
What are you doing down there,
Naruto?

1353
01:22:53,200 --> 01:22:54,860
You better take the day off.

1354
01:22:55,040 --> 01:22:56,020
No more training.

1355
01:22:56,021 --> 01:22:57,680
You've used too much chakra.

1356
01:22:57,860 --> 01:23:00,100
If you push any harder, it could kill you.

1357
01:23:00,280 --> 01:23:01,700
I'm gonna prove it!

1358
01:23:01,820 --> 01:23:02,820
Hm?

1359
01:23:03,260 --> 01:23:04,260
Prove what?

1360
01:23:06,860 --> 01:23:09,020
I'll prove that... that it's true!

1361
01:23:09,220 --> 01:23:11,400
That in this world...

1362
01:23:14,120 --> 01:23:16,240
...there are real heroes!

1363
01:23:16,380 --> 01:23:17,380
TURYA!

1364
01:24:16,940 --> 01:24:17,760
TURYA!

1365
01:24:17,760 --> 01:24:18,760
Good

1366
01:24:24,600 --> 01:24:26,820
morning, everyone!

1367
01:24:28,440 --> 01:24:29,440
AAAAAaaghhhhhhh.

1368
01:24:30,130 --> 01:24:31,130
Here.

1369
01:24:31,710 --> 01:24:32,710
Oh, thank you.

1370
01:24:33,045 --> 01:24:34,045
Naruto's not here.

1371
01:24:34,590 --> 01:24:36,180
Looks like he was out all night again.

1372
01:24:36,440 --> 01:24:37,840
He's gone completely crazy.

1373
01:24:38,080 --> 01:24:39,820
He's out climbing trees in the dark.

1374
01:24:40,490 --> 01:24:41,620
He could be dead by now.

1375
01:24:42,150 --> 01:24:44,220
You know, from using up too much of his
chakra.

1376
01:24:45,580 --> 01:24:46,900
Well, I certainly hope he's okay.

1377
01:24:47,620 --> 01:24:49,580
A child spending the night in the woods
alone.

1378
01:24:50,410 --> 01:24:51,650
There's nothing to worry about.

1379
01:24:51,930 --> 01:24:54,900
Naruto's a goofy kid, but he's also a
full-fledged ninja.

1380
01:24:55,230 --> 01:24:56,230
He can handle himself.

1381
01:24:56,349 --> 01:24:57,349
Sakura's right.

1382
01:24:58,075 --> 01:24:59,300
Naruto's such a loser.

1383
01:24:59,890 --> 01:25:01,900
He's probably lying out there dead
somewhere.

1384
01:25:12,015 --> 01:25:13,810
You'll catch cold if you sleep here.

1385
01:25:14,000 --> 01:25:15,000
Wake up.

1386
01:25:22,515 --> 01:25:24,250
Who the heck are you?

1387
01:25:24,910 --> 01:25:30,650
Oh, uh, uh, I mean... Hi there,
where did you come from?

1388
01:25:30,710 --> 01:25:33,090
You know, what are you doing out here and
all that?

1389
01:25:33,910 --> 01:25:35,130
I'm gathering herbs.

1390
01:25:36,190 --> 01:25:37,190
Herbs?

1391
01:25:37,410 --> 01:25:37,930
Yes.

1392
01:25:38,190 --> 01:25:38,530
That's right.

1393
01:25:38,910 --> 01:25:41,310
They're for treating illnesses and healing
wounds.

1394
01:25:49,940 --> 01:25:52,040
You start work early, huh, sis?

1395
01:25:52,485 --> 01:25:53,680
I like it early.

1396
01:25:53,860 --> 01:25:57,280
It's calm, but I didn't think I'd find
anyone sleeping out here in the woods.

1397
01:25:58,960 --> 01:25:59,960
I'm training.

1398
01:26:01,780 --> 01:26:03,420
So are you a ninja?

1399
01:26:03,800 --> 01:26:06,480
Because I noticed that headband you're
wearing.

1400
01:26:07,160 --> 01:26:09,400
Or are you just making a fashion
statement?

1401
01:26:09,940 --> 01:26:10,860
You noticed that?

1402
01:26:10,940 --> 01:26:11,700
Oh, right.

1403
01:26:11,960 --> 01:26:14,060
Only supercoolninja can wear these.

1404
01:26:14,660 --> 01:26:15,660
Oh, really?

1405
01:26:16,180 --> 01:26:16,940
I see.

1406
01:26:17,060 --> 01:26:18,300
That's very impressive.

1407
01:26:21,620 --> 01:26:24,680
But... does that mean you're training for
something dangerous?

1408
01:26:25,060 --> 01:26:27,460
I'm just developing my skills so I can get
stronger!

1409
01:26:27,980 --> 01:26:29,980
You seem very strong now.

1410
01:26:30,080 --> 01:26:31,080
Isn't that enough?

1411
01:26:31,560 --> 01:26:33,760
No, no, I need to get stronger and
stronger!

1412
01:26:34,080 --> 01:26:35,120
I have to keep practicing!

1413
01:26:37,220 --> 01:26:38,220
How so?

1414
01:26:38,700 --> 01:26:39,380
Why so?

1415
01:26:39,381 --> 01:26:40,100
Why is it so important?

1416
01:26:40,400 --> 01:26:42,700
So I can become the best ninja in my
village!

1417
01:26:42,960 --> 01:26:46,040
Then everyone will know who I am and
they'll all respect me!

1418
01:26:46,340 --> 01:26:50,040
There's also a certain person,
a kid, that I have to prove something to!

1419
01:26:51,460 --> 01:26:53,760
So are you doing it for this certain
person?

1420
01:26:54,640 --> 01:26:57,020
Or are you doing all this training for
yourself?

1421
01:27:00,500 --> 01:27:02,220
What are you laughing about?

1422
01:27:02,360 --> 01:27:03,360
What's so funny?

1423
01:27:04,755 --> 01:27:07,780
Is there someone who's precious to you?

1424
01:27:08,760 --> 01:27:09,840
Someone who...

1425
01:27:10,660 --> 01:27:11,720
What are you saying, sis?

1426
01:27:11,960 --> 01:27:13,000
What do you mean precious?

1427
01:27:16,220 --> 01:27:17,400
What's she thinking?

1428
01:27:18,080 --> 01:27:22,660
You see, when a person has something
precious that they want to protect,

1429
01:27:22,870 --> 01:27:25,540
then they become genuinely strong.

1430
01:27:31,560 --> 01:27:34,840
If you ever lay a hand on my sensei...

1431
01:27:35,680 --> 01:27:36,980
I'll kill you!

1432
01:27:37,780 --> 01:27:39,680
Yeah, I hear ya!

1433
01:27:39,740 --> 01:27:41,240
I know exactly what you're saying!

1434
01:27:45,660 --> 01:27:46,660
You will get strong.

1435
01:27:47,450 --> 01:27:48,450
Very strong.

1436
01:27:49,960 --> 01:27:50,960
Goodbye.

1437
01:27:51,400 --> 01:27:52,440
We'll meet again sometime.

1438
01:27:54,610 --> 01:27:58,220
Oh, by the way... I'm a boy.

1439
01:27:59,010 --> 01:28:01,160
No way!

1440
01:28:01,460 --> 01:28:02,860
He's prettier than Sakura!

1441
01:28:24,450 --> 01:28:25,576
You won't be able to get over me,
Sakuya!

1442
01:28:25,600 --> 01:28:26,230
I've had enough, Sakuya!

1443
01:28:26,231 --> 01:28:29,750
I've seen a lot of weird things in my life
before, but this one takes the cake!

1444
01:28:30,040 --> 01:28:31,690
Ow, hey, what did you do that for?

1445
01:28:31,691 --> 01:28:32,170
Hey, Torb.

1446
01:28:32,171 --> 01:28:32,710
Cut it out!

1447
01:28:32,870 --> 01:28:34,310
Did you just forget about breakfast?

1448
01:28:34,970 --> 01:28:35,970
You're such a loser.

1449
01:28:36,250 --> 01:28:37,250
Huh?

1450
01:28:38,110 --> 01:28:40,150
Hehe... Huh?

1451
01:28:41,970 --> 01:28:42,970
Naruto?

1452
01:28:47,480 --> 01:28:49,360
Knowing Naruto, he could be anywhere.

1453
01:28:49,361 --> 01:28:51,600
And Sasuke hasn't come back either.

1454
01:28:51,720 --> 01:28:52,740
I wonder where they are.

1455
01:28:55,840 --> 01:28:56,840
Wow!

1456
01:29:01,340 --> 01:29:04,120
Naruto can climb that high now using his
chakra?

1457
01:29:04,920 --> 01:29:05,920
That's great!

1458
01:29:07,240 --> 01:29:08,180
What do you think?

1459
01:29:08,260 --> 01:29:09,340
High enough for you guys?

1460
01:29:09,520 --> 01:29:10,720
I mean, it's a long way?

1461
01:29:17,840 --> 01:29:19,520
Oh, Naruto!

1462
01:29:21,780 --> 01:29:22,780
Ah!

1463
01:29:26,560 --> 01:29:27,560
Just kidding!

1464
01:29:29,300 --> 01:29:31,600
You guys really fell for it!

1465
01:29:33,500 --> 01:29:35,580
We were worried about you, Naruto!

1466
01:29:36,400 --> 01:29:38,000
I'm gonna strangle you!

1467
01:29:38,300 --> 01:29:39,600
You dork!

1468
01:29:39,800 --> 01:29:42,420
Why do I think this is going to end badly?

1469
01:29:51,960 --> 01:29:52,960
Ugh...

1470
01:29:56,860 --> 01:29:59,180
You really are a total loser, Naruto.

1471
01:29:59,580 --> 01:30:00,040
Ah!

1472
01:30:00,600 --> 01:30:01,600
Sasuke!

1473
01:30:02,720 --> 01:30:03,840
Alright, Sasuke!

1474
01:30:03,960 --> 01:30:04,960
You're the best!

1475
01:30:05,640 --> 01:30:09,900
If I'm still sane by the time I finish
their training, it'll be a miracle.

1476
01:30:17,150 --> 01:30:17,710
Hmm.

1477
01:30:17,960 --> 01:30:19,350
Naruto Uzumaki, huh?

1478
01:30:25,180 --> 01:30:26,180
Huh?

1479
01:30:26,440 --> 01:30:27,440
Huh?

1480
01:30:27,900 --> 01:30:28,500
Huh?

1481
01:30:28,640 --> 01:30:29,240
Huh?

1482
01:30:29,241 --> 01:30:29,440
Huh?

1483
01:30:29,560 --> 01:30:30,160
Huh?

1484
01:30:30,161 --> 01:30:31,161
Huh?

1485
01:30:32,710 --> 01:30:33,290
Huh?

1486
01:30:33,291 --> 01:30:34,291
Let's go back!

1487
01:30:34,870 --> 01:30:35,870
Alright!

1488
01:30:40,630 --> 01:30:42,450
Now they're both late!

1489
01:30:43,030 --> 01:30:45,010
I wouldn't have expected that from Sasuke!

1490
01:30:50,330 --> 01:30:51,860
What have you been up to?

1491
01:30:51,960 --> 01:30:53,940
You look like something the cat dragged
in.

1492
01:30:55,775 --> 01:30:56,840
We both made it!

1493
01:30:56,880 --> 01:30:59,020
We climbed all the way to the top!

1494
01:31:01,460 --> 01:31:01,980
Good.

1495
01:31:01,981 --> 01:31:03,280
Now we move on.

1496
01:31:03,560 --> 01:31:06,560
Starting tomorrow, you're both bodyguards
for Tazura.

1497
01:31:07,360 --> 01:31:08,360
Alright!

1498
01:31:09,940 --> 01:31:11,560
You are such a loser!

1499
01:31:15,570 --> 01:31:18,720
In a few more days, the bridge will be
finished.

1500
01:31:19,110 --> 01:31:20,560
I have you to thank for that.

1501
01:31:20,900 --> 01:31:23,180
You've all done great, but you've still
got to be careful.

1502
01:31:24,610 --> 01:31:27,660
I've been meaning to ask you this,
but I haven't had the chance until now.

1503
01:31:28,820 --> 01:31:33,721
Why did you stay and protect me, even after
you found out I lied to bring you here?

1504
01:31:33,865 --> 01:31:37,320
Those who stray from the path of justice
have no courage.

1505
01:31:37,415 --> 01:31:41,820
But under the wing of a strong leader,
cowardice cannot survive.

1506
01:32:26,210 --> 01:32:26,430
I care.

1507
01:32:26,830 --> 01:32:28,490
You're nothing but a coward!

1508
01:32:30,310 --> 01:32:30,870
Naruto!

1509
01:32:31,330 --> 01:32:32,570
You went too far!

1510
01:32:37,850 --> 01:32:38,850
Naruto...

1511
01:32:52,265 --> 01:32:54,100
Can I talk to you?

1512
01:33:03,240 --> 01:33:06,430
Naruto can be a little harsh sometimes.

1513
01:33:06,431 --> 01:33:09,030
But he doesn't hate you.

1514
01:33:11,010 --> 01:33:12,910
Your grandfather told us what happened.

1515
01:33:13,490 --> 01:33:14,570
To your father.

1516
01:33:15,840 --> 01:33:20,430
You probably don't know this, but Naruto
also grew up without a father.

1517
01:33:21,290 --> 01:33:24,250
In fact, he never knew either of his
parents.

1518
01:33:25,100 --> 01:33:27,370
And he didn't have a single friend in our
village.

1519
01:33:29,425 --> 01:33:33,990
Still, I've never seen him cry,
sulk, or give up.

1520
01:33:35,025 --> 01:33:37,750
He's always eager to jump in.

1521
01:33:38,430 --> 01:33:40,070
He wants to be respected.

1522
01:33:40,870 --> 01:33:42,110
That's his dream.

1523
01:33:42,430 --> 01:33:45,050
And he'll put his life on the line for
that.

1524
01:33:45,190 --> 01:33:46,230
In a heartbeat.

1525
01:33:47,310 --> 01:33:53,831
My guess is... he just got tired of crying,
and decided to do something about it.

1526
01:33:53,950 --> 01:33:58,370
I think he knows better than any of us
what you're going through.

1527
01:34:00,150 --> 01:34:02,170
What Naruto told you earlier?

1528
01:34:02,171 --> 01:34:08,030
As cruel as it sounded, he's probably told
himself that a thousand times.

1529
01:34:22,210 --> 01:34:23,250
You're recovering quickly.

1530
01:34:25,400 --> 01:34:28,020
Just a little longer, Haku.

1531
01:34:29,040 --> 01:34:30,040
Yes.

1532
01:35:03,330 --> 01:35:04,510
He's sleeping.

1533
01:35:05,010 --> 01:35:06,010
What?

1534
01:35:08,310 --> 01:35:11,390
The only thing I can
think of is... Yeah, me, too.

1535
01:35:11,670 --> 01:35:12,070
So, let's do it.

1536
01:35:12,071 --> 01:35:12,390
Let's return.

1537
01:35:12,610 --> 01:35:14,430
I'll keep you company.

1538
01:35:14,710 --> 01:35:14,750
See you later.

1539
01:35:14,751 --> 01:35:15,751
See you later.

1540
01:35:20,550 --> 01:35:28,550
A little pause... and we are back.

1541
01:35:54,550 --> 01:36:02,550
A little pause... and we are back.

